  "ingredients": [
    "1 (12 pound) bone-in ham",
    "0.5 cup whole cloves",
    "1 (20 ounce) can pineapple rings in heavy syrup",
    "1 (12 fluid ounce) can or bottle lemon-lime flavored carbonated beverage",
    "0.5 cup packed brown sugar",
    "1 (4 ounce) jar chopped maraschino cherries"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (160 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2Yetka_JxxzNeGG4HI3vJms1fAg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-45000-ham-with-pineapple-VAT-step-01-3da817c3159a4210b9f7cd2cbfff922f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/45000/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place ham in a roasting pan. Use a sharp knife to score ham rind with a diamond pattern. Press a clove into the center of each diamond.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3YjTiNMYN3OAocHh_vlXhPBFwsQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-45000-ham-with-pineapple-VAT-step-02-7748b68ae477456ea0ca502b87e5e458.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/45000/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain juice from pineapple rings into a medium bowl; stir in lemon-lime soda and brown sugar.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nNFJuVhmClIE714hwgBmxvJ60pw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-45000-ham-with-pineapple-VAT-step-03-845ba4d486954e228f1d420b40d18423.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/45000/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coat ham with juice mixture and arrange pineapple rings on ham. Place a maraschino cherry in the center of each pineapple ring and secure with a toothpick.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oqk-BdYMJOizmnKpiNsSeB5K-6E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-45000-ham-with-pineapple-VAT-step-04-953d1edbac6d4df6bd4d3fed754bc661.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/45000/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake uncovered, basting frequently with pan juices, in the preheated oven until the internal temperature of the ham is 160 degrees F (72 degrees C), 4 to 5 hours. Be sure the meat thermometer does not touch the bone. Remove toothpicks before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nQmtVbD2AOQTKQBTbE-eQQbfrPQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-45000-ham-with-pineapple-VAT-step-05-d88d4fa5b97f4107862be4143681c288.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/45000/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
